  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v26.8.0 - conversion fidelity release.\n\nNew: side-by-side PDF comparison (SideBySidePdfComparer, SideBySideComparisonOptions) and graphical page diff (GraphicalPdfComparer); PDF 2.0 deprecation gates raising DeprecatedFeatureException.\nHTML->PDF: large fidelity push - print stylesheets and @page sheets, float and multi-column layout, percent / max-content table grids, chart and grid pagination, right-to-left and Word-filtered exports.\nText: ligature handling and word-gap reconstruction, TrueType collection faces, Unicode CMap decoding, symbol fallback, Type3 / ActualText rebuild.\nXFA: dynamic layout - field heights from laid-out content, per-edge border chrome, captions, rich text, dataRef binding and occur rules.\nAlso: PDF/A implementation limits with conformance clauses and part-4 embedded-file semantics, font substitution reporting and SubsetAllFonts embedding, Markdown pipe tables, plus forms, stamps, annotations and rendering fixes.\n\nFull release notes: https://github.com/aspose-pdf-foss/Aspose.PDF-FOSS-for-.NET/releases/tag/v26.8.0",
